# NET-4: own-character prediction + reconciliation (NET-ARCH §5.1). The client simulates every input step as it
# sends it (Net::MovePredictor over Net::StepPawnMove, UE CharacterMovement walking/falling math); the server runs
# the same step per received input and acks it with its full movement state; on a mismatch the client takes the
# server's state and replays its unacked moves (UE saved moves + ClientAdjustPosition); the drawn pawn keeps a
# decaying offset (UE smoothing; drawn at once beyond 384 cm, UE NetworkNoSmoothUpdateDistance). Clock sync: the
# snapshot carries the server's input queue; the client dilates its step rate to keep it at 1.
# Played by scripts/Dev/net_scenario.py (NET-SCENARIO-PLAY, UE Gauntlet's shape): DesertServer --role all + Editor
# client A (headless --play, every frame shot, motion blur off for the run) + DesertNetProbe bot B, both clients on a
# 75 ms each way (150 ms RTT) / 2 % loss link. Pass history (p1-p12, run_all.sh): git log of this file.
# Fence 300001 in WP_Protocol: static box 20 x 180 x 600 cm at x=2500 (z 350-950), ~120 cm above the slope. A's
# frames come from a FIXED side camera at (2100,120,50) that sees A's capsule approach the fence and cross it.
# Net coordinates are Y-up (X, Y, Z); the net pawn position is the FEET.
Мир Content/Scenes/WP_Protocol.desce
Роль server server --role all --source 0,0,0 --pawn assets:Prefabs/Pawn_Test.deprefab --spawn 0,-300,650 --spawn 500,-300,-200 --steps 864000
Ждать server 60 \[Server\] listening on port
Роль A editor account=1 lag=75 loss=2 --play --shot-frames 100000 --shot-every 1 --camera 2100,120,50 --look 0.595,-0.198,0.779 --quality PostProcess.MotionBlurQuality=0 --net-walk-cm 30000 --net-walk-dir 1,0,0 --net-walk-mode sprint --net-jump-every 1.5
Ждать A 1800 \[Net\] in session
Роль B bot account=2 lag=75 loss=2 --seconds 1500
Ждать A 120 \[Net\] predicting own pawn
# Дано: server + A + B on WP_Protocol, link 150 ms / 2 % loss. Когда: A sprints along +X and jumps every 1.5 s.
Ждать A 900 drawn own \((2[4-9]\d\d|[3-9]\d\d\d|\d{5,}),
Тогда A clientA_fence_before the fence (thin green box) beside the slope from the side camera, A's capsule at x >= 2400 next to it or crossing it; sharp (no motion blur)
Ждать A 120 drawn own \((2[5-9]\d\d|[3-9]\d\d\d|\d{5,}),
Тогда A clientA_fence_after A past the fence (x >= 2500), the fence intact behind it; no capsule stuck at x ~2470
